{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"findings\":[{\"title\":\"Empty-build detection uses claimed paths instead of the approved all-paths definition\",\"specimen\":\"commit 62bb4144dc49b05dab6c742651bee05fe2007777; attavo/build.py::build_is_empty, consumed by attavo/build.py, attavo/verify.py, and attavo/doctor.py\",\"retires\":\"The claim-scoped replacement for the approved definition of an empty build; restores comparison of the approval tree to the recorded build tree across every path except paths.records.\",\"rejection_test\":\"tests/test_build.py::test_a_change_outside_claims_but_outside_records_makes_the_build_nonempty; tests/test_verify.py::test_verify_uses_all_paths_except_records_to_decide_whether_a_build_is_empty; tests/test_doctor.py::test_proof_seven_uses_all_paths_except_records_to_decide_whether_an_attested_item_is_empty\",\"severity\":\"Blocking whenever approval..build changes only paths outside the spec's claims and outside paths.records: the approved predicate reports a non-empty build, while build_is_empty reports empty and build halts, verify refuses, and proof seven fails it.\"},{\"title\":\"Criteria are executed from the executor's working tree, not from the detached gate checkout\",\"specimen\":\"attavo/build.py:607, which passes spec_dir / \\\"criteria\\\" / name from the original root to run_criterion while using gate_root only as cwd\",\"retires\":\"The remaining working-tree read in the build gate; closes the ability for an executor's uncommitted edit to a criterion executable to determine the gate result.\",\"rejection_test\":\"tests/test_build.py::test_the_gate_executes_the_committed_criterion_not_an_uncommitted_replacement\",\"severity\":\"Blocking when the executor leaves an uncommitted modification to a criterion and commits any otherwise non-empty claimed change: the detached checkout supplies the cwd, but the modified criterion outside it is executed and can turn a committed criterion failure into a pass.\"}],\"tests_named\":[\"tests/test_build.py::test_a_change_outside_claims_but_outside_records_makes_the_build_nonempty\",\"tests/test_verify.py::test_verify_uses_all_paths_except_records_to_decide_whether_a_build_is_empty\",\"tests/test_doctor.py::test_proof_seven_uses_all_paths_except_records_to_decide_whether_an_attested_item_is_empty\",\"tests/test_build.py::test_the_gate_executes_the_committed_criterion_not_an_uncommitted_replacement\"]}"}}
